# Files a Vercel deployment of this repo must not upload (Sprint 6B).
# vercel.json serves the repo root as the site (outputDirectory "."), so
# everything uploaded is public. Only the pages, assets, api/ and data/ ship.
# Checked 2026-09-24: no public page, stylesheet or script references a path
# below (docs/QA_REPORT.md, ".vercelignore").

# reference checkout of production and local tooling
_reference
node_modules/
.claude/
.vercel/
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store

# generator inputs and helpers (the committed HTML is the build output)
src/
scripts/
serve.json
package.json
package-lock.json

# layout references and internal pages (noindex, never linked from public pages)
template/
styleguide/

# documentation
docs/
README.md

# asset pipeline inputs (Sprint 6A); assets/img/MANIFEST.json stays public as the licence register
assets/slots.json
assets/img/manifest.d/

# Kept on purpose (do not add here):
#   api/    serverless functions; they use only Node built-ins, no npm packages
#   data/   read at runtime by api/chat.js (path.join(process.cwd(), "data", …))
#   .well-known/, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, security.txt, googled143c8bf41723924.html
